      </p>
      <p class="hero__footnote">*DeadBeat's pitch letter still reads "Hello Shampoo."</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!--
  SPONSORS SECTION
  Ad units loaded dynamically (see assets/js/sponsors.js)
-->
<section class="sponsors-section" aria-labelledby="sponsors-section-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="sponsors-section-heading" class="visually-hidden">Current Sponsors</h2>

    <!-- Container for dynamically loaded sponsor cards -->
    <div id="sponsors-grid" class="sponsors-grid">
      <!-- Loading message removed by JavaScript when content loads -->
      <p class="loading-message">Loading sponsors...</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Static fallback for users without JavaScript -->
    <noscript>
      <div class="sponsors-grid">

        <article class="sponsor-card sponsor-card--featured" id="sponsor-durtpoo" data-parody="true">
          <div class="sponsor-card__poster">
            <picture>
              <source srcset="/assets/images/sponsors/durtpoo.webp" type="image/webp">
              <img src="/assets/images/sponsors/durtpoo.png"
                   alt="Vintage-style advertisement: SnowMan stands in a shower wearing sunglasses and a crown of lather on his bald head, holding a bottle of Durtpoo flannel-fresh deep clean"
                   class="sponsor-card__image" loading="lazy">
            </picture>
            <span class="sponsor-card__badge sponsor-card__badge--new">New!</span>
          </div>
          <div class="sponsor-card__content">
            <p class="sponsor-card__eyebrow">A word from our sponsor</p>
            <h3 class="sponsor-card__title">Durtpoo</h3>
            <p class="sponsor-card__tagline">It'll remove the soft.</p>
            <p class="sponsor-card__description">
              Flannel-fresh deep clean in a sixteen-ounce bottle nobody asked for.
              Notes of aged whiskey, iron, and campfire, which is a polite way of
              saying it smells like the shed.
            </p>
            <div class="sponsor-card__actions">
              <span class="sponsor-card__cta sponsor-card__cta--inert">Available Nowhere</span>
            </div>
            <p class="sponsor-card__fineprint">
              Durtpoo is not a real product. SnowMan is a real bald man.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>

      <div class="noscript-message">
        <p>
          <strong>Note:</strong> JavaScript is disabled in your browser.
          You're seeing the one ad we could fit on the page by hand.
          Enable JavaScript for the rest of our advertising empire.
        </p>
      </div>
    </noscript>

  </div>
</section>

<!--
  CALL TO ACTION SECTION
  Pitch to hypothetical future sponsors
-->
<section class="cta-section">
